    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=cmFbJQhqZiLBF9Ij]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=cmFbJQhqZiLBF9Ij]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=cmFbJQhqZiLBF9Ij]]-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=cmFbJQhqZiLBF9Ij]] feet]. </p><p><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]'s next turn. While Poisoned, the target can’t regain Hit Points. </p><p><em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p>",
